                </div>

                <div class="spec-card-face is-back" data-spec-back aria-hidden="true" inert>
                  <p class="spec-back-kicker">
                    <span class="spec-back-stamp">UNSENT</span>
                    <span class="spec-back-title">夹在说明书背面的信</span>
                  </p>
                  <p class="spec-back-note">在 Steam 的签名里，我留了一封很长的信。这里只摘最后一段：</p>
                  <blockquote class="spec-back-quote">
                    “当今晚的烟花把夜空点成白昼，随着开场声起，千万兄弟为你扬帆启航。到时你乘船过月光下的海面，如有浪涛如山，那就是我来见你了。”
                  </blockquote>
